with your teacher

00:12:59.400 --> 00:13:01.240
as to my final choice.

00:13:01.320 --> 00:13:02.400
-Yeah.
-OK.

00:13:02.480 --> 00:13:03.760
That's cool.

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:05.960
-Thank you.
-Thank you very much.

00:13:06.040 --> 00:13:07.600
Go ahead, take this
with you when you go, too.

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:08.560
-Go ahead.
-Oh, OK.

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:09.840
-Alright.
-Take that with you.

00:13:14.080 --> 00:13:16.200
-That went well.
-That was great.

00:13:16.280 --> 00:13:17.520
I mean, I don't know.

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:20.840
It is what it is.
I ain't sweatin' it.

00:13:21.760 --> 00:13:24.040
I got a fucking man at home.
I don't even need this.

00:13:25.080 --> 00:13:26.880
Our little bachelor
