think about

00:14:13.520 --> 00:14:14.880
what I've taught you today

00:14:14.960 --> 00:14:18.240
and try and become
that person

00:14:18.320 --> 00:14:20.040
that I see within you both.

00:14:20.120 --> 00:14:22.760
And having given it
a great deal of thought,

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:24.360
and spoken to Bas,

00:14:24.440 --> 00:14:28.200
I have decided
the winner will be…

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:34.680
The Vivienne.

00:14:36.360 --> 00:14:38.000
-Her?!
-Motherfucker.

00:14:38.080 --> 00:14:40.440
-I'm the lady, love.
-Liz, I can't…

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:42.120
Why?! Why not me, Liz?

00:14:44.600 --> 00:14:46.800
-Go ahead.
-I was honoured.

00:14:46.880 --> 00:14:48.920
I mean, we all saw it
coming, didn't we?

00:14:55.400 --> 00:14:56.560
Bye, bitch.

00:14:58.400 --> 00:15:00.320
I didn't wanna win anyway.

00:15:00.400 --> 00:15:02.600
I don't wanna date him.
Like, are you serious?

00:15:03.720 --> 00:15:05.200
